<mxCell id="c47" value="Enrollment: payment_code and transaction_ref are UNIQUE. (student_id, course_id) is an ordinary index, allowing retry history.&#10;No payments table: payment fields are stored in registrations. expires_at is set by BE to registered_at + 24h.&#10;ENUM members and full constraints are defined in lms_g6_v4.sql. Scores use the 0–10 scale." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;strokeColor=#111111;strokeWidth=1.4;fillColor=#EFF8FC;shape=note;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="1450" width="1740" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
